{"id":"649faa9c6d69237b","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-WellOrder.md","title":"Internal Countable Well Order","display":"df-WellOrder — Internal Countable Well Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-WellOrder","aliases":["62-df-WellOrder"],"display":"df-WellOrder — Internal Countable Well Order","depends_on":["[[62-df-linear-order]]","[[62-df-coded-function]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition V.1.1","source_pages":[168],"source_pdf_pages":[186]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-WellOrder"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-WellOrder</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-WellOrder — Internal Countable Well Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ecc1f15e98d07497\" href=\"?note=ecc1f15e98d07497\" title=\"62-df-linear-order\">62-df-linear-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition V.1.1"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>168</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>186</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>严格序与载体见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ecc1f15e98d07497\" href=\"?note=ecc1f15e98d07497\" title=\"62-df-linear-order\">62-df-linear-order</a>，函数图见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W,R\">\\(W,R\\)</span> 为数的集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 为集合变量。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)\\)</span> 在 Assertion 中引入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}WellOrder}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{LO}(W,R)\\land\n\\neg\\exists f\\bigl[\\mathsf{Fun}(f,N,W)\\land\\forall n\\;(f(n+1)\\prec_R f(n))\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}WellOrder}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{LO}(W,R)\\land\n\\neg\\exists f\\bigl[\\mathsf{Fun}(f,N,W)\\land\\forall n\\;(f(n+1)\\prec_R f(n))\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>与书中定义 V.1.1 一致，良基性以不存在编码的无限下降序列表达。模型中的量词只遍历其集合域，故一个外部非良序可能被非 β 模型判为 WO。不能在元理论中偷偷用外部所有子集的最小元性质替换这个对象公式。空序满足 WO。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Definition V.1.1；纸面页 168；PDF 页 186。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-linear-order","status":"resolved","id":"ecc1f15e98d07497","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-linear-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-coded-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-linear-order","status":"resolved","id":"ecc1f15e98d07497","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"严格序与载体见 [[62-df-linear-order]]，函数图见 [[62-df-coded-function]]。$W,R$ 为数的集合；$f$ 为集合变量。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"严格序与载体见 [[62-df-linear-order]]，函数图见 [[62-df-coded-function]]。$W,R$ 为数的集合；$f$ 为集合变量。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"W,R","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}WellOrder}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{LO}(W,R)\\land\n\\neg\\exists f\\bigl[\\mathsf{Fun}(f,N,W)\\land\\forall n\\;(f(n+1)\\prec_R f(n))\\bigr].","display":true}],"bytes":1255,"backlinks":[{"id":"23442ad478f1b29e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf H_\\theta$ 见 [[62-df-recursion-hierarchy]]，$\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)$ 见 [[62-df-WellOrder]]，$\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]；UC 见 [[62-df-L2]]。所有新变量都满足递归层级定义中的新鲜条件。"},{"id":"0db76c21ee915f76","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"理论和良序见 [[62-df-ACA0]]、[[62-df-WellOrder]]；$\\mathsf H_\\theta$ 及其新鲜变量条件见 [[62-df-recursion-hierarchy]]；UC、$\\vdash_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-L2]]、[[62-df-derivability]]；归纳规则见 [[62-thm-ACA0-transfinite-induction]]。θ 为所引用接口允许的算术公式。"},{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-41","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-WellOrder|Internal Countable Well Order]]"},{"id":"9853288b97e63a4f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"理论、内部良序与算术公式见 [[62-df-ACA0]]、[[62-df-WellOrder]]、[[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]；UC、$\\vdash_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-L2]]、[[62-df-derivability]]。$\\varphi(a,\\bar u,\\bar A)\\in\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)$；W、R 为新集合变量。"},{"id":"258c57f3152fa88d","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"理论见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-ATR0]]；WO 见 [[62-df-WellOrder]]，$\\le_{\\mathrm{ord}}$ 见 [[62-df-order-comparison]]，$\\Sigma^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sep}$ 见 [[62-df-Sigma11-separation]]；$\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。$\\mathrm{CWO}$ 在下式引入。"}],"o